    "sections": {
        "description": "FSE Educational Courses Theme is a full-site editing theme designed for websites that present courses, learning resources, and educational content. It works with the block editor and full-site editing features, allowing users to manage layouts through blocks and editable templates. The theme provides structured sections for displaying course information, featured content, services, and other educational resources. Its responsive layout adapts content to different screen sizes, supporting access from desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. Users can modify colors, typography, templates, and page layouts through the site editor without relying on extensive code changes. Block patterns can help create and arrange commonly used sections across pages. The FSE Educational Courses theme can organize course details, instructor information, learning materials, and calls to action in a clear page structure. Navigation and content sections can also be adjusted to match the website's requirements. Its FSE approach gives administrators control over both individual page content and broader site elements, including headers, footers, and templates. The theme provides a practical foundation for presenting educational courses and related information in a structured online format."
    },
